@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@observabilityToken = replace-with-APP_OBSERVABILITY_METRICS_TOKEN
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token-from-login

### Overall health (public and intentionally hides component details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Liveness: should this process be restarted? (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness: should this process receive traffic? (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Kubernetes-style liveness alias (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/livez

### Kubernetes-style readiness alias (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### Diagnostic endpoint without the operations token (expected 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Prometheus metrics (protected with a separate operations token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
X-Observability-Token: {{observabilityToken}}

### Actuator metric names (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
X-Observability-Token: {{observabilityToken}}

### Feed request with caller-supplied correlation and W3C trace context
# Get accessToken from the Login request in auth.http first.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: local-feed-debug-001
traceparent: 00-0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-b7ad6b7169203331-01
